<title>USA: ARV ups tender offer for Senior Income.</title>
<headline>ARV ups tender offer for Senior Income.</headline>
<dateline>COSTA MESA, Calif. 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>ARV Assisted Living Inc said its LHVRH Inc subsidiary increased the tender offer price for Senior Income Fund LP to $6.50 net per unit in cash.</p>
<p>The offer price is less the amount of distributions made by the partnership from Nov 8 to when the tendered units are purchased.</p>
<p>Under the amended terms, LHVRH increased the number of units it is offering to buy to 2,462,025. The expiration date of the offer has also been extended.</p>
</text>
